<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise 1996 net attrib 1.35 bln francs.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise 1996 net attrib 1.35 bln francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>  Net attributable			   1,349  vs	     906</p>
<p>  Net attributable per share (francs)  22.80  vs	   15.60</p>
<p>  Net dividend (francs)		    12.00  vs	   11.50</p>
<p>  Operating				    5,360  vs	   4,242</p>
<p>  Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 4,239  vs	   3,617</p>
<p>  Cashflow				     7,308  vs	   6,059</p>
<p>  Turnover				    91,620  vs	  85,813</p>
<p>NOTE - Lyonnaise des Eaux gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said 1995 sales are restated and given on a pro-forma basis. It said losses resulting from property activities narrowed in 1996 to 199 million francs, compared with a loss of 309 million for the preceding year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
